563	     * on {@code businessDay}, counting existing owners whose {@code registrationDate} equals that date.
564	     * New owners take {@code businessDay} as their {@code registrationDate} (the supplied or defaulted
565	     * date rolled forward to a business day), so this caps the number that may be created per day.
